    {
      "id": "comp-title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 664,
      "text": "玻璃组件清单",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-06T10:43:13.715Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-06T10:43:13.715Z",
      "version": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "comp-1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 700,
      "text": "GlassCard · 玻璃卡片 —— 半透明渐变底 · 1dp 白高光描边 · 14dp 蓝调投影 · 可选状态顶条",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-06T10:43:13.715Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-06T10:43:13.715Z",
      "version": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "comp-2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 744,
      "text": "GlassButton · Primary —— 深蓝渐变主按钮（#4C6FB4→#2F4C8F→#223660），圆角 15dp",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-06T10:43:13.715Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-06T10:43:13.715Z",
      "version": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "comp-3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 788,
      "text": "GlassButton · Ghost —— 玻璃底次级按钮（描边高光），用于测速 / 重试等次操作",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-06T10:43:13.715Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-06T10:43:13.715Z",
      "version": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "comp-4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 832,
      "text": "GlassTextField —— 无边框圆角输入框（18dp），粘贴链接 / 手动代理地址",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-06T10:43:13.715Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-06T10:43:13.715Z",
      "version": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "comp-5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 876,
      "text": "IosSegmented —— 玻璃分段控件：代理模式 / 主题模式三段切换，选中项深蓝渐变",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-06T10:43:13.715Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-06T10:43:13.715Z",
      "version": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "comp-6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 920,
      "text": "IosProgress · 流光进度 —— 渐变填充 + 移动光斑；pct=null 为扫描不确定态",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-06T10:43:13.715Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-06T10:43:13.715Z",
      "version": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "comp-7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 964,
      "text": "StatusPill · 状态胶囊 —— 16% 色底 + 彩字：排队 / 下载中 / 完成 / 错误 / 部分",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-06T10:43:13.715Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-06T10:43:13.715Z",
      "version": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "comp-8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 1008,
      "text": "IosChip · 筛选胶囊 —— 素材库平台筛选：全部 / X / Instagram / Bluesky",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-06T10:43:13.715Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-06T10:43:13.715Z",
      "version": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "comp-9",
      "type": "text",
